  "description": "PRE-REGISTERED (2026-10-20) BEFORE any run, docs/reports/RW-reescritura-rentable.md §2.3 (published in 00d65b7). D2 redesign of meanrev_stocks: a long-only core of 50 point-in-time S&P 500 members (price >= 5 USD, >= 252 prior closes), reconstituted on the first session of each month by 12-1 momentum (t-252 to t-21), low volatility (-sigma252) or the sum of both ranks; weights proportional to 1/sigma63, cap 4% per name, summing to the overlay exposure (SPY vs SMA200 with a 1% band: 1.0 on, 0.5 off; the plain candidate is always 1.0); daily rebalance with no band, min order 5 USD, fractional shares; no price stops; no Connors satellite this round. Excluded for the shared Alpaca account: momentum_stocks' 11, D1's 18 ETFs and meanrev_stocks' 32. Binding criteria: §2.5 C1-C8. Benchmarks (not trials): SPY; the equal weight of every eligible name, monthly, no overlay. Trials 388 -> 392. ENCODING CORRECTION (2026-10-21, before any D1/D2 trial; the first attempt crashed at its first trial with no result): the protocol loads the warmup BEFORE window.from, so window.from moves from 2016-01-04 to 2017-02-27 = the data start (2016-01-04) + the pre-registered 420-day warmup. Same hypothesis, candidates and criteria.",
